      "releaseNotes": "Updated to version 18.4 of the Database of British and Irish Hills (DoBIH), including an updated revision of the Synges.\n\nUser defined lists now include an option for 600m drop.",
      "releaseDate": "2009-05-25T04:47:51Z",
